Original commit body from 759beb5:

This PR extends variable type inference to C# and Dart analyzers:

- C# analyzer: Added _extract_param_types helper and var_types tracking
  in _extract_edges_from_file. Method calls on typed parameters and
  constructor-assigned variables are now resolved to class methods.

- Dart analyzer: Same pattern - parameter types from function signatures
  and constructor assignments are tracked, enabling type-inferred
  method call resolution (e.g., db.save() -> Database.save).

Both implementations follow the pattern established in Java/Kotlin/TypeScript
(PR #486) and documented in ADR-0006.

Updated ADR-0006 to reflect that C# and Dart now have type inference support.
